18:["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-7 prose prose-1","children":["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Popular routes with this aircraft include Amsterdam, Rotterdam and Brussels. The combination of speed and flexibility makes this aircraft particularly well suited for travellers who wish to fly efficiently without compromising on comfort."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"Accommodating up to 6 passengers, this aircraft is ideal for VIP transfers and short distance travel. Departing from smaller airports, you arrive closer to your final destination while keeping waiting times to a minimum. This makes a significant difference compared to commercial flights."}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"The cabin is designed with calm and functionality in mind. During the flight, you have the opportunity to work, hold discussions or simply relax. Depending on the aircraft type, you will benefit from extra legroom, a quiet cabin and a stable flight experience."}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"For those looking to charter a helicopter from Amsterdam, Rotterdam or Schiphol to destinations such as Amsterdam, Rotterdam and Brussels, the H130 T2 offers an outstanding balance of range, comfort and flexibility."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"children":"Why fly with Aerodynamics"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"At Aerodynamics, it is not just about the aircraft. It is about the complete experience. Since 1986, we have been arranging private flights for both business and leisure clients, with personal"}]]}]}]
